   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "EVD - Iterated density editing reached R-work 0.084 and R-free 0.105",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Compared with 0.093 and 0.109 after the first cycle with the ensemble Fpart/PHIpart map, and 0.128 and 0.147 with the flat mask."
   },
